WEBVTT

00:02.350 --> 00:08.980
I had no idea Emelenzia thought about me that way.

00:10.050 --> 00:11.960
But I’ve got Ayako-san,

00:11.960 --> 00:14.280
and my feelings aren’t going to change.

00:14.750 --> 00:18.860
Am I going to hurt her?

00:36.140 --> 00:41.260
Today I shout out another good morning courageously

00:41.260 --> 00:46.560
The sparkling chime of hope is resounding

00:47.050 --> 00:52.140
The gentle sun is always

00:52.140 --> 00:57.660
Blessing the late coming sensation of the two of them

00:57.950 --> 01:02.880
To fall in love with a goddess is the best!

01:03.090 --> 01:12.950
Even if she is a beatrice I can't control this throbbing feeling

01:12.950 --> 01:13.800
L·O·V·E

01:13.800 --> 01:15.550
I love you MA·MO·RU!

01:15.550 --> 01:17.090
These overflowing feelings

01:17.090 --> 01:19.790
Take them high into the sky

01:19.790 --> 01:24.680
Please grant me my dazzling and sparkling dream

01:24.680 --> 01:26.480
That's right MA·MO·RU!

01:26.480 --> 01:28.010
Only for you

01:28.010 --> 01:30.680
I will show you my power of miracles

01:30.680 --> 01:32.950
I will surely, surely swear

01:32.950 --> 01:38.900
I will not end my Shining Love

02:03.700 --> 02:05.260
Package!

02:07.820 --> 02:11.070
It’s here! It’s here! It’s here! It’s here! It’s here!

02:11.070 --> 02:13.300
I’ve been waiting for this!

02:13.840 --> 02:14.500
Wait!

02:14.500 --> 02:16.620
I need a signature!

02:16.620 --> 02:18.740
Here you go.

02:18.740 --> 02:21.070
It’s finally here!

02:21.070 --> 02:23.530
From the Silver Maria to me!

02:23.880 --> 02:28.770
With this, Ayako-san’s heart is mine!

02:28.770 --> 02:31.160
It’s finally here...

02:32.320 --> 02:36.710
<i>Give this blue box to Witch Beatrice’s boyfriend.</i>

02:36.710 --> 02:42.270
<i>If you do, she’ll stop loving him and start...</i>

02:42.270 --> 02:49.100
<i>loving you! </i> That’s what it says!

02:49.680 --> 02:52.920
The day is mine!

02:52.920 --> 02:55.500
X-Day!

02:55.500 --> 02:58.230
Just wait, Ayako-san.

02:58.230 --> 03:03.280
Soon, I will full-charge your heart!

03:04.760 --> 03:06.970
Just you wait, Yoshimura Mamoru!

03:06.970 --> 03:10.600
You won’t wear that stupid grin much longer!

03:10.600 --> 03:14.020
The countdown has begun!

03:17.440 --> 03:22.070
The Beatrice Disappears?!

03:39.190 --> 03:40.860
Mamoru

03:44.460 --> 03:45.560
Miss!

03:45.560 --> 03:46.780
A call for you.

03:46.780 --> 03:47.780
Come in.

03:48.840 --> 03:52.540
They were asking if Witch Beatrice were in...

03:52.890 --> 03:54.660
Is it from Emelenzia?

03:55.940 --> 03:56.810
Hello...

03:56.810 --> 03:58.380
Hello hello...

03:58.380 --> 03:59.510
It’s been a long time.

03:59.880 --> 04:02.500
We were just at school!

04:02.500 --> 04:05.330
It’s rare for you to call.

04:05.330 --> 04:06.470
What’s up?

04:06.470 --> 04:08.720
I can’t make the chocolate right!

04:08.720 --> 04:10.610
Is there a good way?

04:10.610 --> 04:12.480
Chocolate?

04:12.850 --> 04:19.030
Oh, that stupid “who can give Mamoru chocolate in the most exciting way” plan?

04:19.440 --> 04:20.520
Yes.

04:20.520 --> 04:24.800
Sucks that you get dragged into this stupid thing, too.

04:24.800 --> 04:29.040
No, this is an important part
of our student council activities.

04:29.040 --> 04:32.140
I’m going to fight with everything I have.

04:32.140 --> 04:35.050
Gosh, you sure are serious about some weird things.

04:35.050 --> 04:39.250
I try again and again, but the chocolate
always tastes mysterious.

04:39.250 --> 04:40.670
Valentine’s is tomorrow!

04:40.670 --> 04:42.520
There’s no time!

04:43.970 --> 04:45.180
Fine.

04:45.180 --> 04:47.550
I’ll tell you the important points to making it.

04:47.550 --> 04:48.790
Get a pen and paper.

04:48.790 --> 04:50.390
OK, thank you!

04:51.100 --> 04:56.040
<i>She confessed to Mamoru, with the chocolate I taught her how to make.</i>

04:56.040 --> 04:58.030
<i>Mamoru and Emelenzia...</i>

04:59.840 --> 05:02.190
<i>It’s all right. <i>It’s all right!</i></i>

05:22.780 --> 05:25.010
Thank you, Ayako-san!

05:29.390 --> 05:31.870
It’s so good!

05:31.870 --> 05:34.800
It’s so good, Ayako-san.

05:40.810 --> 05:42.150
<i>I...</i>

05:43.220 --> 05:50.760
<i>Emelenzia Beatrix Rudgir,
have fallen in love with Yoshimura Mamoru!</i>

05:52.210 --> 05:56.120
<i>She seemed really miserable.</i>

05:56.480 --> 05:59.820
<i>I wonder if there’s anything I can do.</i>

06:07.840 --> 06:10.530
<i>I can’t believe I said that.</i>

06:11.180 --> 06:16.270
<i>Confessing my love to Mamoru
in front of Witch Beatrice...</i>

06:17.310 --> 06:21.280
<i>I didn’t want to come between them!</i>

06:22.070 --> 06:22.980
<i>But...</i>

06:26.280 --> 06:27.750
Please!

06:27.750 --> 06:30.330
Someone stop these feelings!

06:30.330 --> 06:32.320
Someone! Someone!

06:33.390 --> 06:34.670
That’s right...

06:36.520 --> 06:38.640
I’ll just have to pound...

06:39.520 --> 06:41.130
Pound?

06:41.140 --> 06:44.410
Pound my way through this!

06:44.410 --> 06:45.090
Boss!

06:46.320 --> 06:48.280
It’s Jirou and Saburou!

06:48.780 --> 06:50.760
Want to go get some food?

06:53.460 --> 06:57.290
Jirou, Saburou, excellent timing.

06:57.290 --> 07:00.480
Teach me to use a brush.

07:00.480 --> 07:01.730
A brush?

07:01.730 --> 07:03.230
Practice Characters
Well Done

07:03.230 --> 07:05.170
A writing brush?

07:05.170 --> 07:07.200
The one you paint with ink with?

07:07.200 --> 07:13.890
Yes. In times like this, it’s best to
write your feelings down formally.

07:13.890 --> 07:15.740
What are you going to write?

07:15.740 --> 07:17.340
Well...

07:24.850 --> 07:26.320
Ayako-san.

07:26.320 --> 07:27.080
Um...

07:27.950 --> 07:31.580
Your chocolate was delicious.

07:31.580 --> 07:32.430
Really!

07:40.560 --> 07:42.980
Ow...

07:42.980 --> 07:44.310
Hey, Kikukawa!

07:44.310 --> 07:45.980
That was dangerous!

07:45.980 --> 07:47.840
Um, well...

07:49.950 --> 07:51.570
Emelenzia!

07:55.270 --> 07:57.380
What are you doing?

08:01.220 --> 08:03.430
Wh-What?

08:04.630 --> 08:07.320
Wh-What is it this time? A love letter?

08:08.060 --> 08:12.260
Witch Beatrice, this is for you.

08:19.230 --> 08:23.400
<i>A challenge to a duel.</i>

08:23.400 --> 08:27.280
<i>I hope that your education is
proceeding steadily apace.</i>

08:27.280 --> 08:35.860
<i>I, Emelenzia Beatrix Rudiger doth forsooth to challenge the Witch Beatrice to a duel.</i>

08:35.860 --> 08:38.910
<i>The plum flowers are starting to bloom, aren’t they?</i>

08:39.630 --> 08:40.900
<i>Sincerely...</i>

08:41.410 --> 08:44.290
Emelenzia, do you know what any of this means?

08:44.290 --> 08:47.530
Yes. I’ve never written one before,

08:47.530 --> 08:51.350
so I spent all night writing it,
with Jirou and Saburou helping.

08:51.350 --> 08:56.610
I’ve heard that before you duel in Japan,
you must write a challenge.

08:56.610 --> 08:58.310
A duel? What do you mean?

08:58.310 --> 09:01.120
I’m not fighting you.

09:01.120 --> 09:03.900
There’s no way you could beat me.

09:03.900 --> 09:05.620
Are you going to run, Beatrice?

09:06.680 --> 09:07.520
What?

09:08.190 --> 09:10.250
I’ll be waiting after school.

09:10.250 --> 09:17.130
If you run, I’ll call you a coward
for the rest of your life.

09:21.010 --> 09:22.670
Emelenzia...

09:27.520 --> 09:29.190
I can’t miss this!

09:29.190 --> 09:30.860
A love triangle!

09:30.860 --> 09:34.240
A messy love triangle!

09:34.240 --> 09:35.970
Love battle!

09:35.970 --> 09:38.050
We should get at least two separate
cameras ready for this, right?

09:38.050 --> 09:40.390
I gotta prepare the newspaper’s special edition!

09:40.390 --> 09:41.510
No...

09:41.510 --> 09:43.520
As the Student Council,

09:43.520 --> 09:46.760
we should try to stop something as violent as a duel.

09:47.990 --> 09:50.900
Brother! Don’t be stupid!

09:50.900 --> 09:54.040
Stuff this fun doesn’t happen often!

09:54.040 --> 09:55.610
That’s right!

09:55.610 --> 09:58.350
Then let’s get started...

10:01.700 --> 10:05.330
This is what they call the perfect chance.

10:05.780 --> 10:09.880
The time has finally come.

10:10.910 --> 10:16.570
Hey, Emelenzia, from year 1,
has challenged Witch Beatrice to a duel!

10:16.570 --> 10:17.400
Seriously?

10:17.400 --> 10:19.520
The Fan Club was making a big deal out of it!

10:31.560 --> 10:34.840
Wait just a second. I’ll switch it on.

10:35.540 --> 10:36.380
Well?

10:36.380 --> 10:37.240
Can you see me?

10:37.240 --> 10:39.620
Perfect! Just perfect!

10:39.620 --> 10:41.910
The live cameras are ready!

10:41.910 --> 10:44.380
Pilder on!

10:44.940 --> 10:47.330
OK!

10:47.330 --> 10:50.080
Cry nice and good, baby...

11:15.980 --> 11:19.740
Certain Victory

11:24.950 --> 11:27.610
Get ready, boss!

11:27.610 --> 11:30.630
Ayako-san... Emelenzia, are you serious?

11:30.630 --> 11:33.060
This is a duel or something, so you shouldn’t do it!

11:33.060 --> 11:36.170
Mamoru, it’s not like a duel.

11:36.170 --> 11:37.300
It is a duel!

11:37.300 --> 11:38.940
That’s right.

11:38.940 --> 11:41.220
I’m so serious, it’s scary.

11:43.550 --> 11:45.100
All ready here.

11:45.100 --> 11:47.810
It’s finally starting.

11:47.810 --> 11:50.230
East-B Student Council
Commentator’s Seats

11:48.450 --> 11:50.230
Everyone, we’re ready to start!

11:50.230 --> 11:58.330
A battle, beyond the likes of which East-B
has ever seen, is about to begin!

11:58.330 --> 12:01.090
A battle between two women
for the heart of the man they love!

12:01.090 --> 12:02.710
You can’t miss it!

12:02.710 --> 12:04.430
Yes! Don’t miss it!

12:04.430 --> 12:07.790
Commentary will be provided by me,
the school’s Venus,

12:07.790 --> 12:11.930
and the school’s Hercules will be providing explanations!

12:11.930 --> 12:13.580
Yo! Check it out!

12:18.190 --> 12:21.240
I’ll begin.

12:29.820 --> 12:32.460
What are you doing?

12:37.660 --> 12:38.790
Amazing!

12:38.790 --> 12:40.820
They’ve gotten off to a great start!

12:41.840 --> 12:43.000
B-Dash!

13:10.480 --> 13:13.830
Witch Beatrice, let’s stop playing around.

13:13.830 --> 13:15.700
Yeah, I agree.

13:17.500 --> 13:19.650
Don’t lose, boss!

13:19.650 --> 13:23.150
The battle’s moved to the woods!

13:23.150 --> 13:25.780
What’s your opinion on the match so far?

13:25.780 --> 13:26.820
Perfect!

13:31.480 --> 13:33.840
I can hear it, Yoshimura Mamoru.

13:33.840 --> 13:36.320
It’s the sound of your destruction.

13:36.320 --> 13:38.170
With the item the Silver Maria has given me—

13:41.710 --> 13:43.590
Just you wait...

14:10.060 --> 14:14.600
Witch Beatrice, is this all the love you have for Mamoru?

14:14.600 --> 14:16.790
It vanished easily.

14:16.790 --> 14:18.040
Stupid kid!

14:19.050 --> 14:20.210
Emelenzia...

14:20.210 --> 14:21.960
Stop provoking her...

14:21.960 --> 14:25.640
That’s enough out of you!

14:28.680 --> 14:29.640
Huge!

14:29.640 --> 14:31.260
Wow!

14:32.510 --> 14:34.090
Emelenzia!

14:36.140 --> 14:40.350
Is this... Is this the end for Emelenzia?

14:40.350 --> 14:41.650
Stand up!

14:41.650 --> 14:43.660
Stand up, Joe!

14:45.820 --> 14:47.260
Emelenzia!

14:53.630 --> 14:55.820
This is nothing.

14:55.820 --> 14:56.830
Don’t worry about me.

14:56.830 --> 14:58.910
You’re so cool, boss!

15:05.090 --> 15:06.960
That’s enough.

15:06.960 --> 15:08.050
This is over.

15:08.050 --> 15:09.550
No, not yet!

15:13.750 --> 15:14.560
Ayako-san!

15:16.330 --> 15:17.980
Enough, already!

15:22.630 --> 15:26.940
You know, better than anyone, that you can’t beat me.

15:26.940 --> 15:28.700
Let’s stop this.

15:28.700 --> 15:29.950
That’s right.

15:29.950 --> 15:31.830
Stop, Emelenzia!

15:32.990 --> 15:35.640
The battle’s heading to its climax...

15:36.160 --> 15:39.100
Oh, we’re very sorry!

15:39.100 --> 15:43.810
It’s just getting good, but we’ve lost video thanks to technical difficulties.

15:44.290 --> 15:47.280
Please enjoy this for a moment.

15:47.280 --> 15:49.190
Please Standby A Moment

15:48.820 --> 15:51.760
Nice pose!

15:52.930 --> 15:53.680
Big!

15:54.310 --> 15:55.970
Witch Beatrice...

15:55.970 --> 15:59.600
Please, take this seriously!

16:00.080 --> 16:02.350
You must defeat me totally!

16:04.860 --> 16:07.190
What is this?

16:07.190 --> 16:08.830
What’s going on?

16:08.830 --> 16:10.730
It’s kind of scary...

16:10.730 --> 16:13.200
Is she still going to fight Ayako-san?

16:18.990 --> 16:21.160
Stop it, I said.

16:23.040 --> 16:24.250
Boss!

16:25.780 --> 16:27.620
Witch Beatrice...

16:27.620 --> 16:29.500
Fight for real.

16:30.800 --> 16:32.200
Please.

16:32.840 --> 16:35.010
Witch Beatrice!

16:52.790 --> 16:55.910
Stop it... Stop it, already, Emelenzia!

16:59.830 --> 17:03.120
That’s enough, Emelenzia.

17:04.260 --> 17:06.540
You really don’t understand, do you?

17:06.540 --> 17:08.960
Mamoru told you to stop, didn’t he?

17:09.880 --> 17:13.570
I wanted you to defeat me utterly...

17:14.460 --> 17:17.420
I know that Mamoru loves you.

17:17.420 --> 17:20.920
And that you love him just as much.

17:20.920 --> 17:26.650
And that there isn’t room for me...
Of course I know that!

17:26.650 --> 17:32.530
But I can’t do anything about these feelings!

17:32.530 --> 17:35.110
I really do love Mamoru!

17:35.970 --> 17:39.990
Even knowing it was impossible,
this was the only way.

17:40.570 --> 17:42.580
I understand that.

17:42.580 --> 17:44.090
Witch Beatrice...

17:45.080 --> 17:46.650
If back then...

17:47.970 --> 17:50.650
If back then, when I confessed to Mamoru...

17:50.650 --> 17:53.090
If he’d had a girlfriend already,

17:53.090 --> 17:55.800
I don’t think I would have backed down.

17:56.970 --> 17:59.920
No, I’m sure I wouldn’t have.

17:59.920 --> 18:03.220
There was a flame burning inside me
I could do nothing about.

18:03.840 --> 18:07.670
Just like you right now, Emelenzia...

18:07.670 --> 18:10.990
Witch Beatrice, I...

18:14.590 --> 18:19.570
I can take your confession to Mamoru
as a declaration of war on me, right?

18:21.700 --> 18:22.960
Yes.

18:22.960 --> 18:24.370
That’s right.

18:27.090 --> 18:29.300
But I won’t give you Mamoru, not ever.

18:29.300 --> 18:31.110
Just like you said,

18:31.110 --> 18:34.500
there’s a deep, deep bond between us,

18:34.500 --> 18:38.400
that you’ll never be able to touch,
in a million years, yes?

18:38.400 --> 18:39.680
You’d best be ready.

18:39.680 --> 18:40.590
Ayako-san...

18:40.590 --> 18:42.290
Of course!

18:42.290 --> 18:45.820
If I weren’t prepared for that,
how could I declare war on you?

18:45.820 --> 18:50.190
No matter what Mamoru says,
I won’t back down that easily!

18:50.190 --> 18:52.700
No, I never will!

18:52.700 --> 18:53.900
Emelenzia!

18:53.900 --> 18:56.000
Fine!

19:03.020 --> 19:05.420
The birth of a beautiful rivalry.

19:05.420 --> 19:07.520
And they all lived happily ever after.

19:07.520 --> 19:09.500
I’m so moved!

19:09.500 --> 19:12.420
Wonderful! Wonderful! Wonderful!

19:16.440 --> 19:17.780
Abiko-sempai!

19:18.900 --> 19:21.590
Is the duel over?

19:21.590 --> 19:25.070
Um, you should be able to see for yourself.

19:25.070 --> 19:28.180
This place is off-limits... You know that?

19:28.570 --> 19:29.620
No!

19:29.620 --> 19:33.680
I have to defeat the hated Yoshimura Mamoru
while they’re fighting!

19:34.450 --> 19:35.400
Abiko-sempai?

19:36.820 --> 19:38.880
No!

19:38.880 --> 19:41.390
I said it’s off limits!

19:41.390 --> 19:42.350
Shut up!

19:42.350 --> 19:43.750
Get off me!

19:43.750 --> 19:46.580
I don’t have time to worry about you!

19:48.430 --> 19:50.290
My glasses, my glasses...

19:50.290 --> 19:52.660
Are you OK, sempai?

19:52.660 --> 19:53.900
Shut up!

19:55.840 --> 19:57.030
<i>Mademoiselle...</i>

19:57.940 --> 19:59.090
So beautiful...

19:59.090 --> 20:00.090
<i>Beautiful girl.</i>

20:01.040 --> 20:03.800
The most handsome man in glasses...

20:03.800 --> 20:05.030
Mitsuki!

20:05.030 --> 20:05.850
Yuuka?

20:05.850 --> 20:07.760
Where are my glasses?

20:07.760 --> 20:08.840
<i>Omega.</i>

20:09.450 --> 20:11.980
I can’t see a thing.

20:11.980 --> 20:12.690
So beautiful...

20:13.060 --> 20:15.100
Hey, what’s wrong, you guys?

20:15.650 --> 20:16.800
<i>My love.</i>

20:22.920 --> 20:25.760
I lost valuable time.

20:26.500 --> 20:28.130
This is...

20:29.400 --> 20:33.800
That’s what you get for touching me, fools.

20:36.630 --> 20:38.610
What are you doing here?

20:39.150 --> 20:40.510
Abiko-sempai?

20:42.480 --> 20:44.510
Yoshimura Mamoru!

20:44.510 --> 20:45.390
Y-Yes!

20:45.390 --> 20:48.490
Ayako-san belongs to me, Abiko Tsuneo!

20:48.490 --> 20:51.560
Get lost, little kid!

20:51.560 --> 20:52.440
What?

20:52.440 --> 20:54.190
Don’t be stupid!

20:54.190 --> 20:58.660
Today will be our first day, you and me!

20:59.700 --> 21:02.600
Take this!

21:06.870 --> 21:09.090
This is... A Horacle?

21:09.740 --> 21:11.510
Witch Beatrice!

21:11.510 --> 21:12.310
The beatrice...

21:18.520 --> 21:19.480
Ayako!

21:19.990 --> 21:21.510
Ayako-san?

21:22.130 --> 21:23.310
Ayako-san!

21:33.050 --> 21:34.660
The beatrice...

22:01.290 --> 22:06.970
My heart is racing and I'm going to give you

22:06.970 --> 22:12.170
This sparkling emotion

22:12.560 --> 22:18.300
The evening color is dyed into this orange shirt

22:18.360 --> 22:23.450
I catch it from behind you and my heart throbbing

22:23.560 --> 22:30.410
It's an everyday thrill just to be with you

22:30.410 --> 22:37.840
I can't say it well enough but thank you

22:37.840 --> 22:43.040
Venus Dream the hidden power

22:43.040 --> 22:49.240
This feeling will change into that power

22:49.240 --> 22:54.360
Power Dream I found what I want to protect

22:54.360 --> 23:00.770
That is your smile and your feelings

23:14.820 --> 23:16.530
Okada-san!

23:16.530 --> 23:18.960
Is your preview comment ready?

23:18.960 --> 23:24.130
Okada-san may have left on a journey to a faraway place...

23:24.130 --> 23:27.760
Maybe... Maybe overseas to report on something?

23:27.760 --> 23:31.890
A vacation on a tropical island, maybe?

23:33.480 --> 23:36.020
It’s not good to be nosy like that.

23:36.020 --> 23:37.410
Don’t worry.

23:37.410 --> 23:39.180
I’m sure next week...

23:39.180 --> 23:42.460
Next time: Don’t Leave Me.

23:39.180 --> 23:43.980
Don’t Leave Me
